574 0 obj
  << /ActualText (LOGO 2\nStructure\nBold \034A\035 ke andar interconnected geometric forms se ek integrated symbol create hota hai\056 Is structure mein India ke map ka subtle abstract form bhi hidden hai\056\nCore Concept\nIndia \222 Manufacturing \222 Precision Components \222 Global Reach\nLogo Alok ki identity ko Indian manufacturing roots se lekar larger global B2B ambition tak represent karta hai\056\nIndia Representation\n\034A\035 ke andar jo distinctive broken\057segmented form \046\077\026\076\010 \046G\044\076 hai\054 woh India ke geographical form se inspired visual reference hai\056\nYe element Alok ki Indian origin\054 Indian manufacturing foundation aur home\055grown industrial identity ko represent karta hai\056\nIndia ko literal map ki tarah draw karne ke bajay usse abstract geometry mein integrate kiya gaya hai\054 jisse logo corporate aur international feel maintain karta hai\056\n\034A\035 Symbolism\nOuter \034A\035 \075 Alok \053 India ki strong manufacturing foundation\056\nIndia\055inspired inner form \075 Indian roots\054 identity aur manufacturing origin\056\nInterconnected geometry \075 multiple components\054 processes aur capabilities working together\056\nManufacturing Philosophy\nIndia\055inspired form aur engineered geometric structure milkar ek clear message create karte hain\072\n\034From Indian manufacturing roots to precision components used in larger systems\056\035\nLogo Alok ko sirf spare\055parts seller nahi\054 balki Indian component\055manufacturing ecosystem ka part position karta hai\056\nDesign Language\nGeometric construction \075 Engineering \053 precision \053 industrial discipline\056\nInterlocking forms \075 Fitment \053 compatibility \053 reliability\056\nNegative space \075 Smart engineering \053 efficient design thinking\056\nStrong outer structure \075 Stability \053 consistency \053 long\055term growth\056\nColour Meaning\nOrange element \075 Indian energy\054 ambition\054 growth aur forward movement\056\nDark structural element \075 Industrial strength\054 engineering confidence aur reliability\056\nProduct Connection\nAlok ke float valves\054 push cocks\054 waste pipes\054 waste couplings\054 bushes\054 connecting bushes\054 locks\054 hinges\054 handles aur other components ko ye symbol \050ek larger Indian component ecosystem ke parts ke roop mein connect karta hai\056\nClient POV\nLogo ka message ho sakta hai\072\n\034An Indian company engineering the small components that keep larger cooling systems working\056\035\nIsse Alok ki perception ek ordinary spare\055parts supplier se elevate hokar specialized Indian B2B component brand ki taraf move hoti hai\056\nBrand Mindset\nIndian Roots \222 Engineering Precision \222 Component Expertise \222 Global Ambition\nInternational Vision\nIndia ka reference logo ko strong origin deta hai\054 while abstract geometric construction usse overly regional nahi banne deta\056\nIsliye identity ka visual message hai\072\n\034Rooted in India\056 Built through engineering\056 Ready for the world\056\035\nStrategic Strength\nIndia ka reference Alok ki origin ko permanently establish karta hai\054 lekin logo kisi specific product ya cooling equipment ki shape tak restricted nahi hai\056\nFuture mein Alok naye components\054 categories aur markets mein expand kare\054 to India \222 Engineering \222 Global B2B ki same brand story continue reh sakti hai\056\nOne Line Philosophy\nIndian Roots \222 Precision Engineering \222 Global Possibility)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 575 0 R
     /Pg 572 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
