576 0 obj
  << /ActualText (LOGO 3\nStructure\nEk powerful \034A\035 ke andar multiple abstract component\055like forms construct kiye gaye hain\056\nCore Concept\nMany Parts\056 One Alok\056\nSymbolism\nOuter \034A\035\072 Alok ki foundation\054 stability aur long term direction\056\nInner vertical element\072 Backbone \057 central system \222 consistency \046 reliability\056\nLeft flowing form\072 Movement\054 supply flow aur adaptability\056\nRight orange form\072 Growth\054 transformation aur forward movement\056\nLower grey forms\072 Multiple supporting components working together\056\nDesign Philosophy\nInterconnected geometry Alok ke spare parts ka actual business philosophy represent karti hai\072 small precision components supporting larger cooling systems\056\nLayering\072 Component \222 Assembly \222 Complete System\056\nCurves\072 Practicality\054 usability aur smooth functional movement\056\nAngular transitions\072 Engineering precision\054 controlled manufacturing \046 structural strength\056\nNegative space\072 Hidden connections\056 Parts ke beech jo relationship hota hai\054 wahi Alok ki real value ko represent karta hai\056\nProduct Connection\nValves\054 bushes\054 pipes\054 couplings\054 locks\054 hinges\054 handles aur other spare components ko one connected ecosystem ke concept mein bring karta hai\056\nClient POV\nLogo \034plastic\035 ko literal plastic icon se represent nahi karta\056 Instead\054 engineering aur component expertise communicate karta hai\056\nBrand Mindset\n\034Every small component has a role in keeping the larger system working\056\035\nInternational Vision\nSymbolic\054 abstract aur scalable construction Alok ko sirf local spare parts seller nahi\054 balki professional B2B component brand ke direction mein position karta hai\056\nStrategic Strength\nYe logo kisi specific cooler\054 freezer ya individual product ki image par dependent nahi hai\056 Isliye future categories aur larger B2B expansion ke liye flexible hai\056\nOne Line Philosophy\nMany Parts \222 One Reliable System)
