580 0 obj
  << /ActualText (LOGO 1\nStructure\n\034A L O K\035 ko ek continuous geometric form mein merge kiya gaya hai\056\nCore Concept\nParts \222 Connection \222 Complete System\056 Alok sirf individual spare parts nahi\054 cooling equipment ke larger system ka component partner hai\056\nSymbolism\nLeft \034A\035\072 Alok ki identity \053 upward movement\057growth\056\nCentre form\072 Interlocking\057connected geometry \222 components ka precise fit \046 compatibility\056\nRight angular form\072 Forward direction \222 progress\054 expansion \046 future readiness\056\nOpen negative space\072 Simplicity \053 engineering precision\073 unnecessary complexity nahi\056\nDesign Language\nCurves \075 functionality\057flow\056\nSharp edges \075 engineering\054 accuracy \046 reliability\056\nProduct Connection\nBushes\054 valves\054 cocks\054 pipes\054 couplings\054 hinges\054 handles jaise individual components milkar larger cooling systems complete karte hain\056\nClient POV\nLogo brand ko generic plastic manufacturer ke bajay specialized component supplier ke roop mein present karta hai\056\nBrand Mindset\n\034We don\047t just make parts\073 we make components that fit into a system\056\035\nInternational Vision\nCompact geometric symbol \053 clean wordmark Alok ko Indian origin se beyond industrial\057B2B global identity ki direction deta hai\056\nStrategic Strength\nProduct\055specific icon nahi hai\056 Ye component ecosystem ko represent karta hai\054 isliye future product expansion ke saath bhi relevant rahega\056\nOne Line Philosophy\nConnected Components \222 Complete Systems)
